A voice assistant that actually controls your Android phone.

Say "Purity, ..." and it can read the screen, tap, type, open apps, send texts, call contacts, set alarms, control media, run privileged shell via Shizuku, and more.

## Build
Push to GitHub -> Actions -> download Purity-APK artifact.

## First run
1. Install the APK.
2. Open Purity, paste your Claude API key.
3. Tap buttons 1-6 in order.
